WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.568
I want to read you

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.903
some of what Fox issued as a statement

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.271
after the deal.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:06.373
They wrote,

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.540
We acknowledge the court's

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:08.942
rulings finding certain claims

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.410
about Dominion to be false.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.811
I want to ask you about that in a second.

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.214
But first, they go on to say this

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:15.548
settlement reflects Fox's

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:16.950
continued commitment

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.618
to the highest journalistic

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.020
standards, unquote,

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.354
Is that how you see the settlement

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.722
as an example of Fox's

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:24.357
commitment to the highest level

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.926
of journalistic standards?

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:30.330
Thanks for having me on.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.065
For us at Dominion,

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:32.799
this has always been

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:34.801
about getting the truth out

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:37.170
and holding the different entities

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.073
that have defamed us to account.

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:42.108
The fact that the world knows

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:44.511
all the details behind that

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:45.345
and behind

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:46.679
what happened in particular

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.281
with Fox Corp. and Fox News.

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:49.682
And it

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:50.283
did come out

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:53.453
in our motion for summary judgment

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:54.521
meant that meant for us

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:55.822
that we had accomplished that.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:57.624
The only remaining

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:00.660
item for us was for the jury to set the

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:04.264
the amount and the liability.

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:06.132
And ultimately

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.401
a lot of people don't appreciate

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.703
what goes into a trial.

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.739
We have a lot of employees

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:14.641
that have experienced trauma,

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:17.210
and we have six more trials

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:17.544
to go.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:18.945
And I suspect that

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:20.046
they will go all the way

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:22.449
to a jury verdict on all other six.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.350
And that's something that

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.518
we don't take lightly.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:26.252
We've asked

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.455
a lot of our election officials

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:30.056
to testify

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.592
for no personal gain of their own.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:34.260
And frankly,

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:35.995
they all said, yes, everyone

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:37.764
we had asked said yes.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:40.200
And that's not an easy thing for us

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.067
to ask of,

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:42.368
and it's not something we did lightly,

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.370
especially considering

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.606
we have six more to go. Right.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:47.173
You mentioned

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:49.109
all the traumatized employees

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.610
of Dominion.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:53.313
I don't I don't doubt it for a second.

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:54.747
What's going to happen with them?

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:55.381
Obviously,

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:56.616
the private equity managers

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:57.450
that own dominion

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.752
are going to get a lot of money.

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:00.220
Obviously,

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.020
those lawyers

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:01.921
are going to get a lot of money.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.356
I imagine a third or so.

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:04.924
That's usually how these things go.

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:05.625
What's going to happen

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:06.392
with those employees

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:07.360
you say are traumatized

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.228
or are they going to

00:02:08.228 --> 00:02:12.065
get any of this huge settlement

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:16.002
Those are terrible assumptions, Jake.

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.670
Our partners at Staples St Capital

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.571
have been nothing other

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.940
than unconditionally supportive of us.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.909
The only question

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:25.345
that they really ever asked to me

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:27.247
and our employees during this time

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:28.615
was how they could help.

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:29.482
In the early days,

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:31.050
it was

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.453
I reached out to them and asked them

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:35.155
for help assembling the legal team.

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.991
So you bring up the legal team. We had,

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.026
I think, the assembled,

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:41.528
the best group of lawyers

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:43.229
that anyone really could ever hope for.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:44.264
And I think it showed

00:02:44.264 --> 00:02:47.000
in the judge's remarks the other day.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.236
And as far as our employees, absolutely,

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:51.938
we have a number of employees

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:53.806
that are shareholders.

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.141
And our commitment

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:56.609
has always been to our shareholders.

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:57.143
Absolutely.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:58.912
Every one of our employees

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:00.980
will benefit from this

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.348
and our customers will benefit

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:03.583
from this from

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:04.984
the fact that we have longevity

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:06.186
as a company.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.554
You said in the press conference

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:08.821
right after the settlement was announced

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:09.189
at Fox

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:09.956
that apologized

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:11.257
for telling those election lines.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.692
They they didn't apologize.

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:14.327
They said in their statement

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:15.528
that they acknowledge

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.030
that the court's ruling finds

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:17.797
certain claims

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:19.399
about Dominion to be false.

00:03:19.399 --> 00:03:20.934
They don't even acknowledge

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:23.970
that those false statements are theirs,

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.772
and they didn't have to acknowledge

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:26.806
any of this on air.

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:27.574
How did that work?

00:03:27.574 --> 00:03:28.942
Did you want them to go on

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:31.744
air and apologize and say, we misled you?

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:32.312
And they said, well,

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:33.980
how about we give you $100 million more

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.848
and we don't have to do that?

00:03:35.848 --> 00:03:36.316
I mean,

00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:37.784
where was the negotiation

00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:40.453
on making sure that their viewers

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.989
who are the ones that believe these lies

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:43.623
and interviewers

00:03:43.623 --> 00:03:45.225
don't believe these lies?

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:48.595
ABC, NBC, CBS, PBS, MSNBC,

00:03:48.761 --> 00:03:49.662
they don't believe the lies.

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:52.232
It's Fox viewers believe these lies.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:54.100
Why not get them to acknowledge it?

00:03:56.469 --> 00:03:57.403
I suppose for

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:58.137
myself, I have

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:00.773
not really thought through,

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:02.642
and I think we probably disagree

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:03.476
on the effect of what

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:05.011
an apology really

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:07.547
would mean for their viewers.

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:09.682
Viewers turn to their trusted

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:11.684
media sources, whatever the channel is.

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:15.688
And for us, it was about accountability

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:17.857
and we if anything,

00:04:18.391 --> 00:04:20.493
we wanted this settlement.

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:21.628
And the dollars obviously

00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:23.396
are very significant for any entity,

00:04:23.396 --> 00:04:25.798
including Fox. That's huge.

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:27.700
To me, it's huge.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.669
And I think lies have consequences.

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:31.471
As Justin Nielsen, in that press

00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:32.872
release that you played out

00:04:32.872 --> 00:04:35.341
at the beginning of the sport here,

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:38.311
but for any media company, Jake,

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:39.245
I'm sure you included,

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:41.848
the next time you decide to make

00:04:41.848 --> 00:04:43.082
a statement that you're

00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:44.384
that your fact checkers are telling you

00:04:44.384 --> 00:04:45.518
is not true,

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:46.052
you know,

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:47.520
you should probably apologize

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:48.688
in two days in a row.

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:50.123
That doesn't you're probably apologizing.

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:51.124
But journalists and journalists

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:51.891
don't do that.

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.693
And I'm like, look,

00:04:53.693 --> 00:04:55.428
every journalist makes mistakes.

00:04:55.428 --> 00:04:57.497
I mean, that is just that happens.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.366
But but the kind of deception

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:03.169
that you and your lawyers laid out

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:06.306
multiple lies over and over,

00:05:06.306 --> 00:05:08.308
over the course of months,

00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:10.977
text messaging and emails suggesting

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:12.278
that they knew

00:05:12.278 --> 00:05:13.980
that the guests were spewing lies.

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:14.981
They knew that

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:17.183
that some of their own hosts,

00:05:17.183 --> 00:05:18.451
like Maria Bartiromo,

00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:19.352
were saying things

00:05:19.352 --> 00:05:20.219
that were not true

00:05:20.219 --> 00:05:22.455
that they did not believe to be true.

00:05:22.455 --> 00:05:23.122
So it's not

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:26.259
what Fox, the settlement they pay.

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:26.859
That's nothing to do

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:28.161
with what I do for a living.

00:05:28.161 --> 00:05:29.529
And when I make a mistake, I go on air.

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:30.330
I apologize.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.798
I you know, it happens.

00:05:31.798 --> 00:05:33.266
Everybody makes mistakes.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:35.134
This is not a mistake.

00:05:35.134 --> 00:05:36.336
This is malice.

00:05:36.336 --> 00:05:38.438
This is lying to the American people.

00:05:38.438 --> 00:05:39.539
And honestly,

00:05:39.539 --> 00:05:40.573
John Fox barely

00:05:40.573 --> 00:05:42.141
covered this on their website yesterday.

00:05:42.141 --> 00:05:43.443
We found one article

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:44.410
buried deep

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.778
on their website about the settlement.

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:48.481
It does not mention the 787.5

00:05:48.748 --> 00:05:51.017
historic million dollar amount.

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:52.352
You said this morning

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:53.553
you hope that Fox is going to learn

00:05:53.553 --> 00:05:54.921
the lesson, start telling the truth.

00:05:54.921 --> 00:05:56.522
Have you seen any evidence

00:05:56.522 --> 00:05:57.190
that they're going to start

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:58.324
telling the truth?

00:05:59.592 --> 00:06:00.159
Well, Jake,

00:06:00.159 --> 00:06:03.062
you said a number of things there.

00:06:03.062 --> 00:06:04.831
To me, the fact that, you know,

00:06:04.831 --> 00:06:06.299
all these facts

00:06:06.299 --> 00:06:07.734
has meant that we reached

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:09.602
one part of our goal

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:10.503
that's very important

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:12.538
for us, for our employees

00:06:12.538 --> 00:06:14.307
and for our customers.

00:06:14.307 --> 00:06:14.807
And the fact

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:16.309
that everyone in the world knows

00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:17.610
these facts is a testament

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.979
to the fact that we had the support

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:22.582
to take this through with our team

00:06:22.582 --> 00:06:24.050
all the way to summary judgment.

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:27.720
We also felt that the the amount of money

00:06:28.121 --> 00:06:30.423
that was paid speaks for itself.

00:06:33.126 --> 00:06:34.660
We may disagree.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.596
We may agree to disagree on on

00:06:36.596 --> 00:06:38.865
what an apology would actually do.

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:40.266
I'm more concerned

00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:42.368
about the next instance.

00:06:42.368 --> 00:06:44.137
On any channel.

00:06:44.137 --> 00:06:46.739
My hope is that media tells the truth.

00:06:46.739 --> 00:06:48.908
We have a very high standard

00:06:48.908 --> 00:06:51.110
for individuals to sue media companies

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.111
for defamation.

00:06:52.111 --> 00:06:52.945
In my opinion,

00:06:52.945 --> 00:06:54.113
it's exactly the way it should be.

00:06:54.113 --> 00:06:55.882
It should be a high standard.

00:06:55.882 --> 00:06:57.417
I think that media

00:06:57.417 --> 00:06:58.117
can be expected

00:06:58.117 --> 00:07:00.486
once in a while to get things wrong

00:07:00.486 --> 00:07:01.988
and then correct it

00:07:01.988 --> 00:07:03.823
in pursuit of the truth.

00:07:03.823 --> 00:07:04.891
But this is something different.

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:06.159
This was 20 statements over

00:07:06.159 --> 00:07:07.960
two and a half months, right?

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.829
This was not a case of them

00:07:09.829 --> 00:07:11.364
not knowing the truth.

00:07:11.364 --> 00:07:12.398
And that is laid out

00:07:12.398 --> 00:07:14.467
very, very clearly in the motion

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:16.202
for summary judgment.

00:07:16.202 --> 00:07:17.870
And in the judge's words,

00:07:19.138 --> 00:07:21.841
quote, It is crystal clear

00:07:21.841 --> 00:07:24.210
that you did not rig the 2020 election.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:24.977
Of course they didn't.

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:26.012
Of course you didn't.

00:07:26.012 --> 00:07:27.780
And neither did Smartmatic.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.915
Of course, the Italians,

00:07:28.915 --> 00:07:31.517
I mean, it's so nonsensical all of it.

00:07:32.552 --> 00:07:35.054
And yet they completely abdicated

00:07:35.388 --> 00:07:37.824
whatever pretense observers ever had.

00:07:38.024 --> 00:07:39.492
And it really honestly,

00:07:39.492 --> 00:07:40.760
this has nothing to do

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:44.330
with what every other news network does.

00:07:44.597 --> 00:07:45.231
This has to do

00:07:45.231 --> 00:07:47.500
with Fox and James McConnell and

00:07:49.202 --> 00:07:50.636
Jake You say that it's

00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:51.571
of course we didn't.

00:07:51.571 --> 00:07:52.772
And that's great

00:07:52.772 --> 00:07:53.739
that you never believed that.

00:07:53.739 --> 00:07:54.774
I can tell you

00:07:54.774 --> 00:07:56.342
that there is a large

00:07:56.342 --> 00:07:57.543
percent of the population

00:07:57.543 --> 00:07:58.411
that did believe it

00:07:58.411 --> 00:08:00.012
because they tune in to Fox

00:08:00.012 --> 00:08:01.247
as the sad news source.

00:08:01.247 --> 00:08:02.215
But that's my question.

00:08:02.215 --> 00:08:05.418
Why not force them to tell

00:08:05.451 --> 00:08:06.519
all those people,

00:08:06.519 --> 00:08:08.721
all those misled Americans,

00:08:08.721 --> 00:08:10.156
which polls indicate

00:08:10.156 --> 00:08:11.023
millions of them

00:08:11.023 --> 00:08:13.092
still believe this nonsense?

00:08:13.092 --> 00:08:15.361
Why not force them to say

00:08:15.495 --> 00:08:17.230
we shouldn't have done that?

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:18.698
That was false.

00:08:18.698 --> 00:08:20.433
You have been misled.

00:08:20.433 --> 00:08:22.235
Joe Biden actually won

00:08:22.235 --> 00:08:23.803
Dominion and Smartmatic

00:08:23.803 --> 00:08:25.805
and all that stuff was operating fine.

00:08:25.838 --> 00:08:27.273
Why not force them to do that?

00:08:27.273 --> 00:08:28.808
Was was it just like,

00:08:28.808 --> 00:08:30.877
we'll give you $200 million more

00:08:30.877 --> 00:08:32.245
if you don't force us to do it,

00:08:32.245 --> 00:08:32.912
because you could have

00:08:32.912 --> 00:08:33.779
forced them to do it.

00:08:36.148 --> 00:08:38.551
Well, A the defamation

00:08:39.318 --> 00:08:41.387
the defamation part of the law

00:08:41.654 --> 00:08:43.656
is really not built around apologies.

00:08:44.123 --> 00:08:46.492
It is built to

00:08:46.492 --> 00:08:48.094
compensate for damage.

00:08:48.094 --> 00:08:49.529
And I can tell you,

00:08:49.529 --> 00:08:51.631
we had a companywide call yesterday

00:08:51.964 --> 00:08:55.101
and the unanimous consent in our company

00:08:55.101 --> 00:08:57.236
is if we could trade this all in

00:08:57.236 --> 00:08:58.070
and go back in time

00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.639
and have our company reputation back,

00:08:59.639 --> 00:09:00.940
we would do so. Exactly.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:03.409
Single time. Exactly.

00:09:03.409 --> 00:09:04.544
That's but that's my point.

00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:05.278
What is that?

00:09:05.278 --> 00:09:06.445
What are your plans for the company?

00:09:06.445 --> 00:09:07.680
I mean, can you continue?

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:10.583
There are still these people out there,

00:09:10.583 --> 00:09:12.051
elections officials,

00:09:12.051 --> 00:09:14.554
who are refusing to use certain software.

00:09:14.587 --> 00:09:16.322
There are still individuals

00:09:16.322 --> 00:09:18.457
who are associated with Donald Trump

00:09:18.457 --> 00:09:19.759
still out there, like saying

00:09:19.759 --> 00:09:21.327
